{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2608231","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年东京雨中赏樱","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"因故来到雨中的东京，偶然发现日枝神社，在雨声相伴下欣赏了美丽的樱花。","date":"2016-04-07","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 雨桜","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 雨桜","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2608231.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160410034253id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2608231.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":422,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2608231/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/001-6da996f689.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"因故来到雨中的东京，偶然发现日枝神社，在雨声相伴下欣赏了美丽的樱花。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">大家</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今年赏花了吗？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">因为我当时在八丈岛</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没能参加公司的赏花大会</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">所以一直没赏花！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今天因为有事来到下着雨的东京</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">赤坂见附</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">在大楼与大楼之间</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">发现了鸟居……\n    <br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/001-6da996f689.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/001-6da996f689.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\n哇！\n而且！\n樱花开着呢！！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n所以说\n决定顺道去一趟\n日枝神社！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n鸟居说到……\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/002-fcff1e6c16.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/002-fcff1e6c16.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n当然是\n狛犬大人！\n真是威风凛凛！！\n（看嘴巴就知道哪个是阿形、哪个是吽形了吧）\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n这么威风的雕像……\n调查一番\n找到按钮\n然后冒出阶梯，或者发生什么事件（笑）\n↑\n（职业病）\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n呃——\n重新振作一下……\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n目标是樱花！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/003-3e4047f0df.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/003-3e4047f0df.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哦——！真漂亮！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n雨中樱花！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/004-3cd772ae80.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/004-3cd772ae80.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n已经有相当多\n花瓣落下来了\n不过，落下的樱花铺成的地毯\n也同样\n美丽！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/005-cea035defb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/005-cea035defb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n只有雨声在回响\n从樱花和树干中\n仿佛连它们的呼吸\n都能听见。\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n用五感感受\n生命的\n美好。\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/006-3ae2987403.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/006-3ae2987403.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n五片淡淡的粉色花瓣\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n娇美的花朵\n随着节奏整齐排列\n整棵树\n也变得美丽而闪耀。\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n总觉得\n度过了一段\n非常美好的时光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/007-301c58611b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/007-301c58611b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n谢谢你们\n\n日枝神社的樱花们！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠）\n想详细了解\n日枝神社的朋友请看这里！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/008-babe2bec39.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/008-babe2bec39.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/009-706eaeb5cb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/009-706eaeb5cb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/010-41f478fc4b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/010-41f478fc4b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"604\" height=\"828\"></a></figure>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">みなさん</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今年 花見をしましたか？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">マスダは八丈島にいたので</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">会社の花見大会に参加できず</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">花見をしてませんでした！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">用事があって本日 雨の降る東京</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">赤坂見附</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ビルとビルに挟まれた</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">鳥居発見・・・\n    <br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/001-6da996f689.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/001-6da996f689.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\nおおっ！\nしかも！\n桜が咲いてる！！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nというわけで\n日枝神社に\n寄っていくことに！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n鳥居といえば・・・\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/002-fcff1e6c16.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/002-fcff1e6c16.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n<br>\nもちろん\n狛犬さま！\nすごい立派！！\n（口を見れば阿形、吽形わかるね）\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nこんなに立派な像だと・・\n調べて\nボタン見つけて\n階段出てきたり\n何かイベントが起きそう（笑）\n↑\n（職業病）\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nえー\n気を取り直して・・\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n目指すは桜！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/003-3e4047f0df.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/003-3e4047f0df.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nおー！綺麗！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n雨桜！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/004-3cd772ae80.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/004-3cd772ae80.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nもうかなり\n花びらが落ちてしまってますが\n落ちた桜の絨毯もまた\n美しい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/005-cea035defb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/005-cea035defb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n雨音だけが響く中\n桜の花や幹から\n息づかいさえ\n聞こえて来そう。\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n五感で感じる\n生命の\n素晴らしさ。\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/006-3ae2987403.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/006-3ae2987403.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n5つの淡いピンクの花びら\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n可憐な花が\nリズムよく並び\n樹 そのものが\n美しく輝いていく。\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n何だか\nとても素敵な時間を過ごすことが\nできました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/007-301c58611b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/007-301c58611b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nありがとう\n\n日枝神社の桜たち！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n日枝神社を\n詳しく知りたい方はこちら！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/008-babe2bec39.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/008-babe2bec39.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/009-706eaeb5cb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/009-706eaeb5cb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/010-41f478fc4b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2608231/010-41f478fc4b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"604\" height=\"828\"></a></figure>"}}